I started out as a Ninja and on my 5th or 6th game there was a wand shop. I
started doing some comparison shopping and there was a wand which had a tag of
666 zkmds. What else could this be other than a wand of wishing? Well, I had
only about 100 zkmds and my pet wasn't very cooperative since I didn't have any
tripe rations. So I engraved with the wand and sure enough it was a WOW. During
the process of engraving, it asked for and gave 3 BSOC and then asked what I
wanted to engrave. For this I simply pressed ESC and noticed that the SHK
didn't mind me reciving things. This is great!! I simply engraved with it
within the shop and got all 6 wishes, (I didn't want to waste any wishes on
money or gems so I could pay for it) dropped the empty wand and continued on my
merry way. 

A couple of levels later there was another WOW!! Now I have everything I'd ever
want including
GDSM, ROC, ROTC, ROL, ( I got teleport intrinsic), ShOR, luckstone, Mjollnir,
BOH, speed boots etc.

The Ninja is doing great and at the moment is wreaking havoc at the castle
level. 

Some observations:

I've gotten WOW before the castle level in only two games of thousands I've
played before and even then only one at a time. Has the probability of WOW been
increased? 

My +6 Mjollnir seems very ineffective against most monsters. even orcs need 2-3
hits (with Str and Dex at 18).

Shock resistance (which I don't have yet) has become very important because of
all the arc, spark and lightning bugs. My ROC and ROTC and couple of wands got
blasted by these pesky creatures.

